 "insight": [
  "The non-EU27 countries with the largest changes in Luxembourg's exports between 2005 and 2025 include Brazil, the United Kingdom, and Switzerland.",
  "Brazil's exports increased by 72.1 million euros, a rise of 184.2%, while the United Kingdom's exports decreased by 958.9 million euros, a fall of 72.7%.",
  "Switzerland's exports grew by 121.8 million euros, or 75.4%, and China also saw a significant increase of 97.2 million euros, or 72.2%.",
  "Exports to the Russian Federation dropped sharply by 58.2 million euros, a decrease of 95.4%, marking one of the largest declines.",
  "These values are in current euros and are not adjusted for price changes, which may affect the interpretation of growth or decline."
 ],
